      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwabuya lwamvuthela uIsrayeli ulaka lweNkosi, wabavusela uDavida ngokuthi: Hamba uyebala uIsrayeli loJuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.21.1+1CH.21.2+1CH.21.3+1CH.21.4+1CH.21.5+1CH.21.6+1CH.21.7+1CH.21.8+1CH.21.9+1CH.21.10+1CH.21.11+1CH.21.12+1CH.21.13+1CH.21.14+1CH.21.15+1CH.21.16+1CH.21.17+1CH.21.18+1CH.21.19+1CH.21.20+1CH.21.21+1CH.21.22+1CH.21.23+1CH.21.24+1CH.21.25+1CH.21.26+1CH.21.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Lan 21:1–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho inkosi uDavida yathi kuJowabi lakubaphathi bempi ababelaye: Hambani ezizweni zonke zakoIsrayeli, kusukela koDani kuze kube seBerisheba, libale abantu ukuba ngazi ukuthi banganani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uJowabi wasesithi enkosini: Loba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho ingabandisa abantu baphindwe ngokulikhulu, lenkosi uDavida iphile ize ikubone lokhu, lokho kungayithokozisa ngani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa inkosi yamlaya uJowabi lezinduna zempi ukuba balalele ilizwi layo. Ngakhoke uJowabi lezinduna zempi baphuma enkosini ukuba babale abantu bakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bachapha iJordani, baqalisa eAroweri, lasemzini ophakathi kwesihotsha, baqonda koGadi, badlulela eJazeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebefika eGileyadi laseKadeshi elizweni lamaHethi; bayafika koDani, basuka koDani baqonda eSidoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bayafika enqabeni yaseTire lasemizini yonke yamaHivi lamaKanani; baphuma baya eNegebi yakoJuda eBerisheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebedabule lonke ilizwe, bafika eJerusalema ekupheleni kwenyanga ezificamunwemunye lensuku ezingamatshumi amabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJowabi waseyinika inkosi inani labantu abangaphuma impi; koIsrayeli kwakukhona amadoda ayizinkulungwane ezingamakhulu aficaminwembili; amadoda akoJuda ayeyizinkulungwane ezingamakhulu amahlanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wahlabeka enhliziyweni emva kokubala kwakhe abantu. Wathi eNkosini: Ngonile kakhulu ngalokho engikwenzileyo. Ngakho, Nkosi, ngiyakuncenga, akuthethelele ububi benceku yakho, ngoba ngenzile ubuthutha obukhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi uDavida esevukile ekuseni, kwafika ilizwi leNkosi kumprofethi uGadi, umboni kaDavida, lathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamba uyetshela uDavida ukuthi iNkosi ithi: Ngikubekela izinto ezintathu; khetha enye kuzo ukuba ngiyenze kuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGadi wasefika kuDavida, wamtshela wathi: Kufike kuwe yini iminyaka emithathu yendlala elizweni lakini, loba ubalekele izitha zakho inyanga ezintathu zixotshana lawe; ingabe kube khona umkhuhlane okwensuku ezintathu elizweni lakini na? Ake ucabange, ubone ukuba yimpendulo bani engizayibuyisela kongithumileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasesithi kuGadi: Ngisebunzimeni obukhulu; kungcono ukuba ngiwele esandleni seNkosi, ngoba umusa wayo mkhulu, kulokuba ngiwele esandleni somuntu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho iNkosi yasithumela umkhuhlane kuIsrayeli, kusukela ekuseni kwaze kwaba sesikhathini esimisiweyo; kwafa abantu abayizinkulungwane ezingamatshumi ayisikhombisa kusukela koDani kwaze kwaba seBerisheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho isithunywa siselulela isandla eJerusalema ukulibhubhisa, iNkosi uNkulunkulu yazisola ngalobobubi, yathi kuso isithunywa esasibhubhisa abantu: Yekela! Sekwanele. Isithunywa seNkosi sasisesizeni sikaAruwana waseJebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasekhuluma eNkosini lapho ebona isithunywa esasibulala abantu, wathi: Khangela, yimi engonileyo, isono ngesami; pho, lezizimvu zenzeni na? Isandla sakho kasibe phezu kwami laphezu kwendlu kababa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UGadi wafika kuDavida ngalolosuku, wathi kuye: Hamba, wakhele iNkosi ialtare esizeni sikaAruwana waseJebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasehambake njengokutsho kukaGadi, lanjengokulaya kweNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uAruwana elunguza, wabona inkosi uDavida lenceku zayo besiza kuye; waphuma, wakhuleka kuyo ethe mbo ngobuso phansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAruwana wathi: Kungani ukuba inkosi yami ize encekwini yayo na? UDavida wathi: Ukuba ngithenge kuwe isiza, ngiyakhele iNkosi ialtare, ukuze umkhuhlane udede ebantwini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAruwana wasesithi kuDavida: Inkosi yami ingathatha inikele ngalokho ekubona kufanele; nanzi inkabi zeminikelo yokutshiswa, nanzi lezimbulo lamajogwe enkabi kube zinkuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UArawana wayinika inkosi konke lokhu; wathi kuyo: INkosi uNkulunkulu wakho kayikwamukele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa inkosi yathi kuAruwana: Atshi bo, ngizakukuthenga kuwe ngenani elithile; kangiyikunikela iminikelo yokutshiswa eNkosini uNkulunkulu wami engangibizanga lutho. UDavida wasesithenga isiza lenkabi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " esiliva angamatshumi amahlanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wayakhela khona iNkosi ialtare, wanikela iminikelo yokutshiswa leminikelo yokuthula. INkosi yakuzwa ukukhulekelwa kwelizwe, umkhuhlane waphela koIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.24.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
